<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Auspine has settled damages claim.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Auspine has settled damages claim.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Australian timber group Auspine Ltd said on Tuesday it had settled a claim made by Rodney Hartley for alleged damages for loss of future fees as chairman of the company.</p>
<p>No payment has been made relating to Hartley's resignation as a director, Auspine said.</p>
<p>Hartley resigned on Monday, citing a breakdown in the operations of the board of directors.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
